sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Caller
    participant E as RefreshEngine
    participant ST as StateStore
    participant S as ResourceSource
    participant O as RefreshOperation

    C->>E: refresh(mode, ...)
    E->>ST: load_all()
    ST-->>E: previous states
    E->>S: discover()
    S-->>E: DiscoveryResult(resources, complete)
    loop each resource, bounded by max_concurrency
        alt reliable cheap indicator unchanged
            E->>E: reuse the previous state
        else otherwise
            E->>S: snapshot(resource)
            S-->>E: ResourceSnapshot
            E->>E: fingerprint and classify
        end
    end
    E->>E: plan operations in dependency order
    loop each planned resource, dependencies first
        E->>O: operation(resource, snapshot, action, request)
        O-->>E: success or exception, retried per RetryConfig
    end
    E->>ST: commit successful state in one transaction
    E-->>C: RefreshResult
